      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Solar quotes worked really well for us organising the suppliers to contact us for arranging a quote. Three suppliers had their own specialist representatives and we arranged to meet them on site with 30 minutes between each rep.  Our decision came down to two suppliers, one was more expensive, but had a really professional approach and was local. In the end, our budget won out and we went with the cheapest. Tips: know the system size you need and stick to it. If a supplier wants to sell you a bigger system, get him to provide it as supplementary to the original size. Then ask the other suppliers to quote on that size as well. You will end up with 6 quotes (ie 3 for a 3 kW system and 3 for a 5kW system). We stuck with the 3kW simply to stay within budget. Look at the warranty periods and inclusion/exclusions. We had the option of higher spec panels and components, but the warranty on the base system met our needs.",
